<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p data-pm-slice="1 1 []" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Hello,</p><p data-pm-slice="1 1 []" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">In accordance with the terms of the Agreement, we requested a reconciliation of your future receivables to make sure the remittance amount aligned with your actual receivables.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p style=""><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">To complete the request, you required to provide us with the last two months of bank statements for your designated account within 5 days of the request.&nbsp; We have not received them within the time allotted and as a result, your remittance amount will return to the Initial Remittance amount of&nbsp;</span><b>{!Case.Payment_Amount__c}</b><span style="font-size: 12pt;">, as specified in the agreement.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=""><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></font></p><p style=""><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">The remit will be returned to the Initial Remittance amount effective immediately.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=""><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></font></p><p style=""><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Please don’t hesitate to contact us with any questions.</p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Thank you,</p><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="arial">{!User.Name} |&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Title}</span></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}</b></font></p></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</font></div></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="arial">P:&nbsp;{!User.Phone} | F:&nbsp;{!User.Fax}</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span style="font-family: arial;">E:&nbsp;{!User.Email}</span></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>